  "id": "16/G",
  "goal": "Explain the foundational model of tracking in XR systems, including its scope, tracker-placement methods, and process stages.",
  "achieves": "Provides the conceptual foundation for understanding XR hardware and software and for approaching the design and implementation of tracking in XR systems with confidence."
 },
 "objectives": [
